{"overview":"فیلومینا کانک از متخصصان سؤالات سخت‌گیرانه‌ای درباره تاریخ سینما می‌پرسد؛ از اختراع دوربین تا فیلمسازان موج نو دههٔ ۶۰، تا ورود CGI و آیندهٔ هوش مصنوعی. کانک سعی می‌کند همه را در صندلی‌های پر از لایه و پاپ‌کورن کهنه باز کند و بپرسد سینما از کجا آمده؟ چرا؟ چه می‌خواهد؟ و چرا نمی‌تواند به ما بگوید؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Philomena Cunk asks experts all of the hard-hitting questions about the history of cinema, from the invention of the camera, to the New Wave filmmakers of the 60s, right up to the entrance of CGI and what the future of AI holds. Cunk will attempt to demystify it all while sitting in lumpy seats with stale popcorn, asking herself where did cinema come from? And why? What does it want? And why can't it tell us?","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":3,"y":2026,"poster":"/zrrRRvavkLQupkC6aEkdA8sX4E8.jpg"}],"episodes":3,"crew":["Charlie Brooker"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB"],"cast":[{"name":"دیان مورگان","role":"Philomena Cunk","photo":"/46Mdcr9ycOaLCKApoj101Cx1c1S.jpg","en":"Diane Morgan"}],"trailer":"_qD_dLCMa3w","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335981-cunk-on-cinema/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335981-cunk-on-cinema/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"BBC iPlayer","kind":"free","logo":"/vi6XJCpJ9GpAPD3rDSRzMC812Z.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335981-cunk-on-cinema/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"}]},"DE":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/335981-cunk-on-cinema/watch?locale=DE","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ad